# `src/data/` holds the structured pipeline: the value model, the planner and the tools.
#
# Un-ignored explicitly because a global ignore file may well exclude `data` directories — build
# output and datasets are usually called that — and one silently swallowing source is a bad way to
# find out. This repository's `data` is code.
!src/data/
!src/data/**
